="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13348" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13348"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyypprv/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика, ИНН)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13349/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13349" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13349"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy7beps/"></a>назначенной на основании приказа руководителя (заместителя руководителя):</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13350/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13350" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13350"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmenmrg/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:54%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13351/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13351" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasubwuxm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4vo8e2/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-