d="13371" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13371"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashkhwxc/"></a>Назначить</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:82%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13372/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13372" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13372"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg4mn3i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13373/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13373" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13373"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmamlu0/"></a>экспертизу</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:12%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13374/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13374" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13374"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastge08q/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:82%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13375/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13375" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13375"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasad5khh/"></a>(наименование экспертизы)</p></td><td style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13376/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13376" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13376"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4z8qe7/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:27%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13377/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13377" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13377"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmksuta/"></a>и поручить проведение экспертизы</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:73%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13378/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13378" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13378"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso4vywn/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:27%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13379/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13379" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13379"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswzn3vv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:73%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13380/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13380" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13380"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasht2m1c/"></a>(наименование организации или Ф.И.О. эксперта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13381/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13381" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13381"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasz8r4at/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика, у которого должна быть произведена экспертиза)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13382/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13382" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13382"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspbd0k3/"></a>Поставить перед экспертом следующие вопросы:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13383/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13383" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13383"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspgx5eg/"></a>1. ______________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13384/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13384" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13384"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu50pkh/"></a>2. ______________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas704ed9/"></a>Предоставить эксперту следующие материалы:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13386" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13386"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiuno13/"></a>1. ______________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13387/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13387" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13387"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas759iuq/"></a>2. ______________________________________________________________</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:54%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13388/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13388" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13388"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv5kofe/"></a>(должность, наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13389/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13389" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13389"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswi3ty0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:12%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13390/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13390" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13390"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfapmek/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13391/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13391" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13391"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasupf7tl/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqhkx9c/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9zth02/"></a>С постановлением о проведении экспертизы ознакомлен:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:54%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgr8igg/"></a>(должность, Ф.И.О. руководителя организации)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3mgzkb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:12%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn8izti/"></a>(дата)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslvieh9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13398/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13398" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13398"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb9dtoz/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit190/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13399/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13399" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13399"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszpo1g4/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 3 к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13400/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13400" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13400"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascz9nwq/"></a><strong>ПРОТОКОЛ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13401"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyg561b/"></a><strong>о совершении действий при назначении экспертизы</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13402"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd7olpa/"></a>&#171;____&#187; ___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13403"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv8sk88/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13404"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1duhpm/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13405"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase4f03g/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslhgh4d/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrvcxub/"></a>(место составления)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslqbl85/"></a>В соответствии с постановлением № ____ от_____ _____ ______ г.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf8e4xc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasapeorv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy80cmw/"></a>(должность, Ф.И.О. лица, вынесшего постановление,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdginw0/"></a>наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13413/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13413" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13413"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl45evb/"></a>назначена экспертиза</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:83%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13414/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13414" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13414"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskw54d6/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13415/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13415" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13415"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashfezrh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:83%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13416/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13416" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13416"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascuumtc/"></a>(наименование экспертизы)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4sftvw/"></a>у</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:97%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastet85p/"></a>,</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13419/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13419" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13419"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfg1hav/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:97%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13420/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13420" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13420"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0u6rx1/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика, у которого проводится экспертиза)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13421/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13421" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13421"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbhw91z/"></a>которая поручена</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13422/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13422" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13422"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasycgg47/"></a>(Ф.И.О. эксперта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13423/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13423" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13423"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp0s2sw/"></a>Перед экспертизой поставлены следующие вопросы:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13424/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13424" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13424"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7zr2om/"></a>1. _______________________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13425/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13425" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13425"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmom9p4/"></a>2. _______________________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13426/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13426" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13426"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0c78x9/"></a>Для экспертизы предоставлены следующие материалы:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13427/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13427" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13427"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaske3fdq/"></a>1. _______________________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13428/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13428" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13428"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgtncor/"></a>2. _______________________________________________________________________</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13429/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13429" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13429"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasz67ayp/"></a>В соответствии со статьей 150 Налогового кодекса проверяемому лицу разъяснены его права о возможности:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13430/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13430" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13430"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswewvx8/"></a>1) заявить отвод эксперту;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13431/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13431" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13431"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaste0m77/"></a>2) просить о назначении эксперта из числа указанных им лиц;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13432/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13432" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13432"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasklobfl/"></a>3) представить дополнительные вопросы для получения по ним заключения эксперта;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13433/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13433" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13433"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszoh7mt/"></a>4) присутствовать с разрешения должностного лица налогового органа при производстве экспертизы и давать объяснения эксперту;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13434/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13434" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13434"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuaop9e/"></a>5) знакомиться с заключением эксперта;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13435/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13435" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13435"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastg7p9a/"></a>6) представить мотивированное мнение по заключению экспертизы.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:54%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13436/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13436" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13436"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswbvv7k/"></a>(должность инспектора, наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13437/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13437" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13437"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3cupm4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:12%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13438/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13438" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13438"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyfdyz3/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13439/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13439" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13439"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqbvzqa/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13440/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13440" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13440"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswtv7i5/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13441/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13441" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13441"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas08k1g2/"></a>С протоколом ознакомлен:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13442/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13442" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13442"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswp87vu/"></a>(должность, Ф.И.О. руководителя налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13443/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13443" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13443"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp7furb/"></a>(возражения налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13444/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13444" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13444"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv3yfhf/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:27%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13445/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13445" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13445"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqbyg2x/"></a>(дата)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13446/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13446" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13446"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrg7t7u/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:30%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13447/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13447" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13447"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfnosob/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13448/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13448" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13448"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasydymw6/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit191/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13449/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13449" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13449"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9l4tyb/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 3а к Положению</strong></span></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13450/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13450" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13450"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas12vm18/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13451/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13451" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13451"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastpdg8v/"></a><strong>__________________________________</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13452/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13452" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13452"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2qzflt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13453/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13453" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13453"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas62mloe/"></a>наименование налогоплательщика</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13454/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13454" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13454"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas84rgwc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13455/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13455" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13455"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasasno40/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13456/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13456" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13456"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasahw07d/"></a><strong>ИНН _____________________________</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13457/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13457" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13457"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxgoquv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13458/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13458" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13458"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyibstw/"></a>идентификационный номер</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13459/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13459" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13459"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasozhi9r/"></a>налогоплательщика</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13460/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13460" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13460"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn1i1fh/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13461/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13461" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13461"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasadqb1x/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13462/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13462" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13462"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslczugu/"></a><strong>___________________________________</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13463/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13463" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13463"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvtdkkq/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13464/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13464" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13464"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass3siae/"></a>адрес местонахождения (почтовый адрес)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13465/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13465" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13465"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrkobux/"></a><strong>УВЕДОМЛЕНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13466/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13466" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13466"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnxmbhl/"></a><strong>о внесении исправлений в налоговую отчетность</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13467/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13467" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13467"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn4aqgh/"></a>В соответствии со статьей 21 Налогового кодекса налогоплательщик вправе самостоятельно исправлять ошибки, допущенные им при учете объектов налогообложения, исчислении и уплате налогов.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13468/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13468" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13468"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas03rzv6/"></a>В ходе предпроверочного анализа, проведенного согласно статье 138 Налогового кодекса, в Вашей налоговой отчетности выявлены расхождения и (или) ошибки всего на ___________ сум. В том числе:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13469/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13469" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13469"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1m8oe5/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13470/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13470" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13470"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasudtdu6/"></a><strong>Номер критерия</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13471/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13471" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13471"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgra7gi/"></a><strong>Причина возникновения </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13472/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13472" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13472"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgnc552/"></a><strong>расхождения и ошибки</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13473/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13473" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13473"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascd8ipp/"></a><strong>Код вида налога</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13474/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13474" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13474"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastwfk1z/"></a><strong>Вид налога</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13475/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13475" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13475"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasawv0q9/"></a><strong>Налоговый период</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13476/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13476" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13476"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso1xbgf/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13477/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13477" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13477"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasifdwm6/"></a><strong>Сумма расхождения </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13478/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13478" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13478"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas463wlr/"></a><strong>(в сумах)</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13479/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13479" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13479"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqy3swy/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13480/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13480" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13480"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5hppsg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13481/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13481" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13481"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvzsqg8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvaf3qt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasghtszp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8dmy6q/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdzspzm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1xahwo/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasosb00g/"></a>Вам необходимо в течение 10 дней со дня получения настоящего уведомления представить в налоговый орган уточненную налоговую отчетность или обоснование расхождений.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0tzx0q/"></a>Непредставление в установленный срок документов, обосновывающих расхождения, или уточненной налоговой отчетности является основанием для проведения налоговым органом камеральной налоговой проверки у налогоплательщика.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastsabfo/"></a>Настоящее уведомление сформировано автоматически на основании сведений базы данных Государственного налогового комитета.</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit192/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastclzb7/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 4 к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13491" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13491"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas94gfnz/"></a><strong>О ПРОВЕДЕНИИ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13492/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13492" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13492"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase4s72h/"></a><strong>камеральной налоговой проверки</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13493/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13493" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13493"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgq5p0l/"></a>Согласно статье 138 Налогового кодекса Республики Узбекистан в целях проведения камеральной налоговой проверки</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13494/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13494" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13494"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdkm8k3/"></a><strong>П Р И К А З Ы В А Ю:</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13495/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13495" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13495"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvqf6rh/"></a><strong>1. </strong>Произвести камеральную налоговую проверку налогоплательщика (налогового агента)</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13496/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13496" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13496"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp6vgai/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика ( налогового агента), ИНН)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb64xle/"></a>за период деятельности</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:81%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6dxlr7/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdtkexr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:81%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascolivm/"></a>(проверяемый период и виды проверяемых налогов и сборов)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdm6dyn/"></a>на предмет правильности исчисления (удержания) и уплаты (перечисления) налогов и сборов в бюджетную систему.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspt622e/"></a><strong>2. </strong>Проведение проверки в соответствии с требованиями налогового законодательства возлагаются на</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas60z7rb/"></a>(Ф.И.О. должностного лица налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoilqef/"></a><strong>3. </strong>Срок проведения камеральной налоговой проверки устанавливается</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasslvpu0/"></a>с</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasncblc3/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszn165d/"></a>до</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnghbxo/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8i6sfd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv0zmyv/"></a>(день / месяц / год)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1btevh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2gu3ie/"></a>(день / месяц / год)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13513/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13513" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13513"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashuh967/"></a><strong>4. </strong>Контроль за исполнением настоящего приказа возложить на</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13514/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13514" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13514"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastr22qi/"></a>(Ф.И.О. должностного лица налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13515/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13515" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13515"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2b0k6i/"></a><strong>Основание:</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:90%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13516/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13516" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13516"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoclike/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13517/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13517" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13517"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase5fcre/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:90%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13518/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13518" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13518"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswp1vn9/"></a>(основание для проведения камеральной налоговой проверки)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13519/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13519" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13519"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspea3k1/"></a><strong>Начальник</strong></p></td><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0wn47i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9ellqe/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswkl2s0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashlryqs/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasikxzc8/"></a>(Ф.И.О. начальника налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit193/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuim8gh/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 5&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:23%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas66gpfr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:41%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas92vkew/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7faogs/"></a><strong>___________________________________</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13529/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13529" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13529"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuz9tq1/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13530/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13530" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13530"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn52n4a/"></a>(налогового агента), третьего лица)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13531/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13531" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13531"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslbqk58/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13532/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13532" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13532"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0ntsy9/"></a>ИНН: _______________________________</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13533/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13533" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13533"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasokskbm/"></a>(идентификационный номер налогоплательщика)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13534/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13534" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13534"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas25sl45/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13535/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13535" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13535"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasggwxq3/"></a>_______________________________________</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13536/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13536" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13536"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasygp58r/"></a>(адрес местонахождения (почтовой адрес)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13537/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13537" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13537"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas18hcvk/"></a><strong>ЗАПРОС</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13538/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13538" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13538"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq20im0/"></a><strong>о предоставлении документов</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13539/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13539" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13539"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0wrext/"></a>В соответствии со статьей 138 Налогового кодекса и согласно приказу</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13540/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13540" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13540"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbkgk0k/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13541/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13541" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13541"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbm4yd2/"></a>№</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13542/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13542" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13542"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2k3evn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13543/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13543" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13543"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas71kyq2/"></a>от</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13544/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13544" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13544"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1a2uqz/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13545/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13545" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13545"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgvwlev/"></a>(наименование территориального налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13546/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13546" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13546"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6gl85g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13547/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13547" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13547"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas08cxgd/"></a>(номер приказа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13548/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13548" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13548"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskiwxou/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13549/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13549" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13549"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasho4xhd/"></a>(день/ месяц /год)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13550/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13550" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13550"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslbqetd/"></a>проводится камеральная налоговая проверка налогоплательщика (налогового агента)</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13551/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13551" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13551"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoqdc8e/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика (налогового агента), ИНН)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13552/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13552" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13552"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr9wsgg/"></a>В связи с этим просим представить следующие документы (информацию) в течение <strong>пяти рабочих дней </strong> с даты получения данного запроса:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13553/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13553" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13553"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn66gzi/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:98%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13554/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13554" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13554"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdga7ei/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13555/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqbvlfx/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:98%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiipemw/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyqcipd/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:98%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas398r77/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnydqg0/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:98%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqf456l/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0ufw1r/"></a><strong>Предупреждение! </strong>В соответствии со статьей 111 Налогового кодекса налоговый орган вправе приостановить операции по банковским счетам налогоплательщика, если документы по запросу не представлены в сроки, установленные налоговым законодательством.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspahxn6/"></a><strong>Начальник</strong></p></td><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasot68yl/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13564/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13564" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13564"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi5683u/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13565/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13565" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13565"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspad4zi/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13566/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13566" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13566"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasc6alue/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3gzy5v/"></a>(Ф.И.О. начальника налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit194/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1vgrwm/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 6&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasz25mlw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm67953/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8gsalg/"></a><strong>&#171;УТВЕРЖДАЮ&#187;</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyrsyxh/"></a>_______________________________</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasymeuh8/"></a>_______________________________</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas72qwmm/"></a>_______________________________</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas49rx7m/"></a>(наименование налогового органа,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgtgaa0/"></a>Ф.И.О. начальника (заместитель начальника)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrg5ewi/"></a>налогового органа, дата утверждения)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoxzwcw/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:48%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasingbs0/"></a>по результатам проведенной камеральной налоговой проверки</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:52%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf8d25n/"></a>,</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:48%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyu9wzb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:52%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas01f0bp/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика (налогового агента))</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:41%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgytp7x/"></a>состоящего на учете в качестве налогоплательщика в</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:59%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13584" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13584"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9ozl65/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:41%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13585/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13585" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13585"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4b31y2/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:59%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13586/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13586" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13586"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmrwi90/"></a>(наименование территориального налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13587/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13587" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13587"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslbsn6d/"></a><strong>З А К Л Ю Ч Е Н И Е</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13588/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13588" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13588"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl479yi/"></a>По результатам камеральной налоговой проверки, проведенной за дни _________________________ текущего года, согласно приказу</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13589/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13589" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13589"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas77gteh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13590/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13590" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13590"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa3mxto/"></a>№</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13591/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13591" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13591"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas78iuxm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13592/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13592" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13592"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdex2fa/"></a>от</p></td><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13593/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13593" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13593"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyiuo85/"></a>&#171;___&#187;&#160;________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13594/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13594" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13594"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslzdy82/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13595/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13595" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13595"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvlxb05/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13596/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13596" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13596"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso16f6b/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13597/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13597" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13597"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasz6nzwh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13598/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13598" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13598"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslaz00q/"></a>(день/ месяц /год)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13599/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13599" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13599"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasezvauq/"></a>у вышеуказанного налогоплательщика, расположенного по адресу ________________ выявлено следующее:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13600/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13600" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13600"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascawgay/"></a>В ходе проверки были осуществлены:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13601/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13601" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13601"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9m3fx0/"></a>1. Вид проверенного налога и сбора __________________________________________</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13602/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13602" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13602"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasymsa9e/"></a>2. Охваченный налоговый период ____________________________________________</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13603/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13603" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13603"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrv8k6q/"></a>3. По запросу</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13604/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13604" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13604"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8esexg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13605/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13605" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13605"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi3cz65/"></a>№</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13606/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13606" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13606"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2re4s8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13607/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13607" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13607"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszt2zrk/"></a>от &#171;___&#187;&#160;________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13608/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13608" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13608"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfqtk25/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13609/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13609" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13609"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswbdyhk/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13610/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13610" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13610"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8yiem6/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13611/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13611" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13611"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashhhd34/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13612/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13612" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13612"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspmg54l/"></a>(день/месяц/год)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13613/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13613" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13613"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasel7oy9/"></a>у налогоплательщика (налогового агента, третьего лица) были запрошены налоговые отчеты и пояснительные документы по отчету, а также</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:56%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13614/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13614" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13614"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslh0db8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:44%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13615/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13615" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13615"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbag9bq/"></a>информация, связанная с исчислением и уплатой налогов.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:56%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13616/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13616" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13616"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszib7lr/"></a>(вид информации)</p></td><td style="width:44%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13617/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13617" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13617"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf5mt1x/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13618/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13618" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13618"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgqhx7y/"></a>4. В связи с необходимостью участия в выполнении конкретных действий, имеющих значение для проверки:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13619/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13619" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13619"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv8gcbq/"></a>- у гражданина</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13620/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13620" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13620"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszoocvn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:34%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13621/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13621" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13621"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassihl9r/"></a>в качестве свидетеля были взяты показания;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13622/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13622" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13622"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp1lr7d/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13623/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13623" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13623"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy76dli/"></a>(Ф.И.О. гражданина)</p></td><td style="width:34%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13624/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13624" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13624"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasz9sz1h/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13625/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13625" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13625"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso7ypir/"></a>- в качестве специалиста был привлечен</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13626/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13626" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13626"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasctnu5i/"></a>;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13627/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13627" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13627"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoa5p79/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13628/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13628" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13628"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmxa6if/"></a>(Ф.И.О. специалиста)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13629/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13629" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13629"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslr3uwq/"></a>- в качестве эксперта был привлечен</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13630/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13630" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13630"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqivrbl/"></a>;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13631/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13631" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13631"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastw2kns/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13632/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13632" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13632"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfggo51/"></a>(Ф.И.О. эксперта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13633/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13633" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13633"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg8dwsf/"></a>- в качестве переводчика был привлечен</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13634/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13634" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13634"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfnu1rc/"></a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13635/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13635" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13635"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgvkwix/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:65%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13636/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13636" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13636"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasairw06/"></a>(Ф.И.О. переводчика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13637/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13637" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13637"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasighpf8/"></a>5. В ходе проверки в связи с необходимостью дополнительной информации на основании приказа</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13638/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13638" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13638"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasktblko/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13639/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13639" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13639"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0vww99/"></a>№</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13640/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13640" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13640"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbuy7f4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13641/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13641" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13641"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx73srq/"></a>от</p></td><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13642/" data-role="phrase-