sPhr13648/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13648" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13648"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8g7ezg/"></a>осмотрены территория и помещения налогоплательщика.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:23%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13649/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13649" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13649"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskz7y6m/"></a>На основании приказа</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13650/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13650" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13650"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5cweoo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13651/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13651" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13651"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg6tweo/"></a>№</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13652/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13652" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13652"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqqgczs/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13653/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13653" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13653"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0bpyza/