" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13693" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13693"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszliw5v/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13694/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13694" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13694"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasul7r8m/"></a>б)</p></td><td style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13695/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13695" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13695"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxcptu5/"></a>путем перерасчета по</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13696/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13696" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13696"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslbczil/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13697/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13697" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13697"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskwin82/"></a>за период</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:23%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13698/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13698" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13698"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast9mfl9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13699/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13699" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13699"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasugsv36/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13700/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13700" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13700"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2xe52q/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13701/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13701" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13701"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmi4pq4/"></a>сум,</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13702/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13702" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13702"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa5m0kd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13703/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13703" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13703"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3xrx68/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13704/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13704" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13704"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg7imv3/"></a>(вид налога)</p></td><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13705/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13705" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13705"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoa2wh5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:23%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13706/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13706" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13706"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasouioxe/"></a>(налоговый период)</p></td><td style="width:2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13707/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13707" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13707"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7vvb13/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13708/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13708" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13708"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgx3t4o/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13709/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13709" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13709"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm3wo5f/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13710/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13710" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13710"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasheg0f6/"></a><strong>в итоге</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:60%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13711/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13711" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13711"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3watgr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13712/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13712" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13712"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask0whf9/"></a><strong>сум. налогов должно быть уплачено.</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13713/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13713" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13713"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6hcqdv/"></a>7. В ходе проверки выявлены/не выявлены случаи, свидетельствующие о том, что налогоплательщик использовал различные схемы по уклонению от уплаты налоговых платежей либо по уменьшению сумм налогов, в частности:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13714/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13714" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13714"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx6d88l/"></a>8. В ходе камеральной налоговой проверки установлено, что налогоплательщик совершил налоговые правонарушения, предусмотренные статьями</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:84%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13715/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13715" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13715"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascub8wo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13716/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13716" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13716"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas80ldni/"></a>Налогового кодекса.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:84%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13717/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13717" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13717"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg8yw6m/"></a>(указываются соответствующие статьи)</p></td><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13718/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13718" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13718"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasousg7m/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13719/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13719" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13719"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9qqlgc/"></a>9. В результате камеральной налоговой проверки были выявлены/не были выявлены расхождения и ошибки в налоговой отчетности, а также случаи налоговых правонарушений.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13720/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13720" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13720"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl63uko/"></a>Основываясь на вышеизложенном,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13721/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13721" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13721"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv0g91l/"></a><strong>ЗАКЛЮЧЕНИЕ:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13722/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13722" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13722"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask0iv2d/"></a>По результатам проведенной камеральной налоговой проверки</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:64%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13723/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13723" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13723"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnmh4za/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13724/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13724" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13724"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasswwtgk/"></a>налогоплательщику в установленном порядке</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:64%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13725/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13725" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13725"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa92wit/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика)</p></td><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13726/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13726" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13726"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasascyf4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13727/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13727" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13727"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaseadwvx/"></a>необходимо направить требование об устранении выявленных расхождений и ошибок, а также добровольной уплате финансовых санкций за совершение налоговых правонарушений, установленных налоговым законодательством (либо завершить камеральную налоговую проверку в связи с невыявлением расхождений и ошибок в налоговой отчетности, а также случаев налоговых правонарушений).</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13728/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13728" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13728"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7sxs9l/"></a>&#160;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13729/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13729" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13729"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6lgvk0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13730/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13730" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13730"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1ps44v/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13731/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13731" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13731"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascba56q/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13732/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13732" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13732"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfash9dafg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13733/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13733" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13733"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfsqdza/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13734/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13734" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13734"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd0ikih/"></a>(наименование территориального налогового органа и должность)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13735/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13735" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13735"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuc5k9v/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13736/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13736" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13736"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd5kqdf/"></a>(дата)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13737/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13737" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13737"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvcqxl1/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13738/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13738" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13738"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3a4408/"></a>(Ф.И.О. сотрудника)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit195/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13739/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13739" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13739"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasaop3ah/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 7&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13740/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13740" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13740"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfuah7f/"></a><strong>ТРЕБОВАНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13741/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13741" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13741"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgu7flm/"></a><strong>о внесении исправлений в налоговую отчетность</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13742/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13742" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13742"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass4ggy6/"></a>По результатам камеральной налоговой проверки, проведенной на основании статьи 138 Налогового кодекса и приказа</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13743/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13743" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13743"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasor9cla/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13744/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13744" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13744"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2m2ogt/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13745/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13745" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13745"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszcgs7a/"></a>№ ____ от &#171;____&#187;&#160;____________ _________ года.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13746/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13746" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13746"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasumzn7d/"></a>В налоговой отчетности были выявлены следующие расхождения и (или) ошибки:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13747/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13747" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13747"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascpey6g/"></a>Тип отчета</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13748/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13748" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13748"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass15tl8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13749/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13749" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13749"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyldqhx/"></a>Отчетный период</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13750/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13750" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13750"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbdncm8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13751/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13751" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13751"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5b0dbq/"></a>Сумма разницы</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13752/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13752" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13752"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasts63b7/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="3" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13753/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13753" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13753"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasikyats/"></a>выявленные расхождения:</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13754/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13754" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13754"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg745af/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13755/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13755" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13755"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbsv4x0/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13756/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13756" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13756"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswsf6uc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13757/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13757" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13757"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskb5dxy/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13758/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13758" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13758"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi8pzmk/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13759/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13759" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13759"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasosz8bb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13760/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13760" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13760"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasguf2br/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13761/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13761" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13761"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasad8s1r/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13762/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13762" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13762"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasklx8ty/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13763/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13763" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13763"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvneuau/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13764/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13764" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13764"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasedg5ip/"></a>...</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13765/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13765" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13765"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswx6sel/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13766/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13766" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13766"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfigeq8/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="3" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13767/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13767" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13767"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2r3f5n/"></a>выявленные ошибки:</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13768/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13768" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13768"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd4ix9z/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13769/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13769" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13769"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8y0rtg/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13770/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13770" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13770"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasny5pbr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13771/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13771" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13771"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq741fo/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13772/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13772" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13772"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasngdq6f/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13773/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13773" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13773"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgzx49g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13774/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13774" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13774"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgm3nni/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmgm3q9/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13776/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13776" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13776"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas158leh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13777/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13777" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13777"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas94h1oa/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13778/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13778" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13778"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0g4ea1/"></a>...</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13779/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13779" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13779"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl6tels/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13780/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13780" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13780"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspfnki0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13781/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13781" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13781"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascv87yn/"></a>Подробную информацию можно найти в приложении по ссылке*</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13782/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13782" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13782"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso118xn/"></a>В течение 10 дней с даты получения данного требования, налогоплательщику необходимо представить уточненную налоговую отчетность либо обоснование выявленных расхождений или ошибок с приложением подтверждающих документов.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13783/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13783" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13783"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashadfdd/"></a><strong>Предупреждение! </strong>В случае непредставления уточненной налоговой отчетности либо обоснований выявленных расхождений или ошибок в указанные сроки налоговые органы вправе приостановить операции по банковским счетам налогоплательщика согласно статье 111 Налогового кодекса и (или) назначить налоговый аудит в соответствии со статьей 140 Налогового кодекса.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13784/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13784" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13784"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszmf2sx/"></a><strong>Руководитель </strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13785/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13785" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13785"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg9g15a/"></a><strong>(заместитель руководителя)</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13786/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13786" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13786"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxqhgdg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13787/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13787" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13787"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6h2cgs/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13788/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13788" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13788"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas62nohc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:49%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13789/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13789" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13789"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassugql5/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13790/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13790" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13790"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqmfusc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13791/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13791" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13791"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskbvtyc/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit196/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13792/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13792" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13792"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasucofoy/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 8&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13793/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13793" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13793"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasthxyhl/"></a><strong>АКТ № _____</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13794/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13794" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13794"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasercyfy/"></a><strong>о выявленных при камеральной налоговой проверке&#160;</strong><strong>нарушениях налогового законодательства</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13795/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13795" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13795"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfash2du6w/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20__ года</p></td><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13796/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13796" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13796"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgo3hcv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13797/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13797" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13797"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfz55ei/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13798/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13798" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13798"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast4corc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13799/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13799" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13799"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas145hc0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13800/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13800" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13800"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8u5a7t/"></a>(область, район, город)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13801/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13801" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13801"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasucfc2y/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13802/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13802" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13802"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslxhagg/"></a><strong>1. Сведения о проведенной камеральной налоговой проверке</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13803/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13803" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13803"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasufskgu/"></a>1</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13804/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13804" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13804"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass5wxek/"></a>Наименование налогоплательщика</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13805/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13805" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13805"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn3i9bx/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13806/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13806" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13806"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb84wfk/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13807/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13807" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13807"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas40scuf/"></a>2</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13808/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13808" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13808"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskwwstt/"></a>ИНН</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13809/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13809" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13809"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxx7egc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13810/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13810" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13810"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu1a9w7/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13811/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13811" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13811"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6b6ub2/"></a>3</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13812/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13812" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13812"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9mmy3k/"></a>Форма собственности</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13813/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13813" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13813"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg9g4md/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13814/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13814" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13814"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvlgude/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13815/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13815" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13815"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasclu3qv/"></a>4</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13816/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13816" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13816"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5a91r6/"></a>Ф.И.О. руководителя</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13817/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13817" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13817"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7d6dno/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13818/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13818" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13818"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9gzmbc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13819/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13819" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13819"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiaobkq/"></a>5</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13820/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13820" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13820"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6yp1xl/"></a>Адрес местонахождения</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13821/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13821" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13821"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvg9gy4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13822/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13822" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13822"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrmv7ah/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13823/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13823" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13823"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascxk6mo/"></a>6</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13824/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13824" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13824"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas54qw1z/"></a>Наименование налогового органа, проводившего проверку</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13825/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13825" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13825"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1knv79/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13826/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13826" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13826"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswrag28/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13827/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13827" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13827"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb50zhu/"></a>7</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13828/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13828" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13828"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn7bwzl/"></a>Ф.И.О., должность проверяющего должностного лица</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13829/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13829" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13829"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3o3wq4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13830/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13830" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13830"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0qotmp/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13831/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13831" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13831"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuu8i5s/"></a>8</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13832/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13832" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13832"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2br03p/"></a>Дата и номер приказа о назначении камеральной налоговой проверки, дата начала и окончания проверки</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13833/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13833" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13833"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxkrcga/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13834/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13834" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13834"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasead713/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13835/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13835" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_a