reak-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13883/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13883" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13883"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr9lipg/"></a>Вид/наименование дополнительно истребуемых сведений</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13884/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13884" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13884"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas18wzko/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:59%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13885/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13885" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13885"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasogrpxi/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13886/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13886" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13886"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnc2z1m/"></a><strong>5. Обстоятельства совершения налогового правонарушения</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13887/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13887" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13887"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrh2nw3/"></a>1</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13888/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13888" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13888"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2ebw1v/"></a>Документированные факты нарушения законодательства о налогах (сборах)</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13889/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13889" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13889"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1ygdte/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13890/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13890" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13890"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas28c2eh/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13891/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13891" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13891"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxm8aef/"></a>2</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13892/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13892" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13892"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp6v37i/"></a>Ответственность за налоговые правонарушения</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13893/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13893" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13893"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7snbuq/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13894/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13894" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13894"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassl0n17/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13895/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13895" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13895"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4g3scs/"></a>3</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13896/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13896" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13896"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuio52c/"></a>Другие обстоятельства налогового правонарушения</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13897/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13897" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13897"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas103bzw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13898/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13898" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13898"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6ry3sn/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13899/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13899" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13899"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0cs4g0/"></a><strong>6. Заключения по акту камеральной налоговой проверки</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13900/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13900" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13900"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastad0eu/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13901/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13901" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13901"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmqsuru/"></a>1</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width:95%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13902/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13902" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13902"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslgm7g8/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13903/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13903" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13903"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2smq4e/"></a>Доначисление по __________________ в размере ___________________ сум.;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13904/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13904" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13904"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas09az0n/"></a>(наименование налога)</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13905/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13905" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13905"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslw4wax/"></a>Доначисление по __________________ в размере ___________________ сум.;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13906/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13906" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13906"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasckyddt/"></a>(наименование налога)</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13907/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13907" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13907"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr8pnd0/"></a>Доначисление по __________________ в размере ___________________ сум.;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13908/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13908" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13908"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6di17n/"></a>(наименование налога)</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13909/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13909" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13909"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasat5ao9/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13910/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13910" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13910"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas99tumg/"></a>2</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:95%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13911/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13911" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13911"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasocgwcl/"></a>Другие нарушения налогового законодательства, выявленные при камеральной налоговой проверке _______________________________________________________________________________</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13912/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13912" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13912"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6wg2rs/"></a>_______________________________________________________________________________</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13913/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13913" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13913"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrqcw9a/"></a>_______________________________________________________________________________</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13914/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13914" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13914"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw2gxof/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13915/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13915" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13915"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrcyrm7/"></a>В случае несогласия налогоплательщика с изложенными в акте обстоятельствами или заключением по акту налогоплательщик имеет право в течение 10 дней со дня получения акта представить свои возражения в соответствующий налоговый орган.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13916/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13916" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13916"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassngl2z/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13917/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13917" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13917"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas93eipu/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13918/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13918" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13918"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyigg2k/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13919/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13919" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13919"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassacggo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:40%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13920/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13920" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13920"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvekaac/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13921/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13921" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13921"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw2wqvs/"></a>Наименование государственного налогового органа</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13922/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13922" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13922"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass7395y/"></a>и должность ответственного сотрудника, составившего акт</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13923/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13923" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13923"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskk73bf/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13924/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13924" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13924"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8xq5ci/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13925/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13925" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13925"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassv0xpt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:40%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13926/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13926" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13926"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl7zqhu/"></a>Ф.И.О.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13927/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13927" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13927"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslr58bh/"></a><strong>О з н а к о м л е н:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13928/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13928" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13928"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgia2is/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13929/" data-rol