0%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13962/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13962" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13962"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1h8lip/"></a>&#171;___&#187;&#160;________ 20__ года в ____ часов</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:57%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13963/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13963" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13963"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0ezqgx/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13964/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13964" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13964"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnpbnfk/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:57%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13965/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13965" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13965"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx6q76r/"></a>(город, район)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13966/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13966" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13966"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslm8kq9/"></a>Провели контрольную закупку</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13967/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13967" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13967"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3wgkz1/"></a>(адрес осуществления деятельности налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13968/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13968" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13968"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4q22dv/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика или Ф.И.О. физического лица, место жительства, год рождения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13969/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13969" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13969"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasscqdze/"></a>Во время проведения контрольной закупки</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13970/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13970" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13970"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2g1fr4/"></a><strong>У С Т А Н О В Л Е Н О:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13971/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13971" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13971"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi43y0y/"></a>(Ф.И.О. покупателя)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13972/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13972" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13972"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi6ndst/"></a>обратился к</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:87%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13973/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13973" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13973"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgeg4vy/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13974/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13974" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13974"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasza8xlp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:87%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13975/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13975" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13975"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbzc46c/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13976/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13976" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13976"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1lyosc/"></a>,</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13977/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13977" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13977"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrvkl5g/"></a>(Ф.И.О. физического лица, место жительства, год рождения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13978/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13978" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13978"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu1tzam/"></a>приобрел</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13979/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13979" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13979"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas158o36/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:11%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13980/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13980" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13980"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnrgggm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13981/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13981" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13981"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa11u65/"></a>(наименование приобретенных товаров (услуг), количество и стоимость)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" colspan="2" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13982/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13982" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13982"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf9753r/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13983/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13983" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13983"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi0d567/"></a>и передал налогоплательщику (представителю)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:61%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13984/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13984" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13984"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy96633/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13985/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13985" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13985"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastc5lku/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:61%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13986/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13986" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13986"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmycb33/"></a>(серия, номер и номинал банкнот)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13987/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13987" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13987"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspmax14/"></a>всего передано</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:86%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13988/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13988" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13988"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1vpc1h/"></a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13989/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13989" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13989"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas822gzy/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:86%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13990/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13990" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13990"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7a3kp9/"></a>(размер денежных средств цифрами и прописью)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13991/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13991" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13991"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6lwut8/"></a>Налогоплательщик (представитель), передав покупателю запрошенный товар (оказав услугу), вернул сдачу</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13992/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13992" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13992"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastvasnb/"></a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13993/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13993" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13993"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqxx6qy/"></a>(размер сдачи цифрами и прописью)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13994/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13994" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13994"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasudahtn/"></a>Налогоплательщик (представитель) или физическое лицо, получив от покупателя (клиента) уплаченную за товары (услуги) сумму,</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13995/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13995" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13995"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswn603o/"></a>(действия налогоплательщика (представителя))</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13996/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13996" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13996"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgt9771/"></a>(обратная сторона)</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13997/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13997" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13997"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasarqeh9/"></a>После окончания расчета объявлено о проведении проверки. Во время проверки</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13998/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13998" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13998"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspgvfby/"></a><strong>У С Т А Н О В Л Е Н О:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr13999/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="13999" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr13999"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas09pifo/"></a>(описание выявленных случаев)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14000/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14000" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14000"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspn37fx/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14001/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14001" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14001"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase3m7iq/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14002/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14002" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14002"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqglvb0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14003/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14003" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14003"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastgw2z5/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14004/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14004" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14004"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastw2b37/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14005/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14005" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14005"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmup8w3/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14006/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14006" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14006"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4vg2o2/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14007/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14007" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14007"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashnn30k/"></a>&#160;</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14008/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14008" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14008"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq7gg8i/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14009/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14009" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14009"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4snpw8/"></a>После проведения контрольной закупки, завершения взаимных расчетов денежные средства, использованные при проведении контрольной закупки, возвращаются проверяемым налогоплательщиком (представителем) должностному лицу налогового органа, а приобретенные товары (предметы контрольной закупки) должностными лицами налогового органа возвращаются налогоплательщику (его представителю).</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14010/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14010" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14010"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbhagd3/"></a>С протоколом ознакомился и по проведенной контрольной закупке и содержанию протокола заявляю следующее:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14011/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14011" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14011"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastne2mw/"></a>(мнение налогоплательщика (его представителя))</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14012/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14012" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14012"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasidm50u/"></a>Настоящий протокол составлен в трех одинаковых экземплярах и один экземпляр передан налогоплательщику (его представителю), а также зачитан вслух всем лицам, участвовавшим в проведении контрольной закупки.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14013/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14013" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14013"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqslwr7/"></a>Лицо, составившее протокол*</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14014/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14014" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14014"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswh86t0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14015/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14015" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14015"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0bbueq/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14016/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14016" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14016"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf1rza0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14017/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14017" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14017"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase4q33z/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14018/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14018" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14018"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascf2tm3/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14019/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14019" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14019"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4mgb5z/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14020/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14020" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14020"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskio6dy/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14021/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14021" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14021"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas597xye/"></a>Покупатель (при привлечении)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14022/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14022" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14022"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbb1h8t/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14023/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14023" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14023"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5x9so6/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14024/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14024" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14024"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasubx2gf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14025/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14025" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14025"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas64ev75/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14026/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14026" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14026"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyi3gnx/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14027/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14027" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14027"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2i0gb5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14028/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14028" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14028"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvagxcl/"></a>(Ф.И.О, место жительства, год рождения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14029/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14029" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14029"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascxb7ra/"></a>Налогоплательщик</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14030/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14030" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14030"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2fd68k/"></a>(его представитель):</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14031/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14031" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14031"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas04hkld/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14032/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14032" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14032"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascmzf4s/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14033/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14033" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14033"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas41dr57/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14034/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14034" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14034"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmsfrxg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14035/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14035" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14035"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgy3la6/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14036/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14036" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14036"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasurq94f/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14037/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14037" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14037"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw2ldew/"></a>(Ф.И.О, место жительства, год рождения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14038/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14038" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14038"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasydl3da/"></a><strong>Примечание:</strong></p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14039/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14039" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14039"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmpr8ga/"></a>*) в случае составления протокола несколькими лицами, заполняется всеми.</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit198/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14040/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14040" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14040"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9i0rn5/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 10&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14041/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14041" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14041"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9o0q3v/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14042/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14042" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14042"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6ccxeg/"></a><strong>пересчета остатка наличных денег</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14043/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14043" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14043"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasclqd3s/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;____________ 20__ года</p></td><td style="width:30%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14044/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14044" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14044"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoxyscn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14045/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14045" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14045"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxikz2n/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14046/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14046" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14046"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasddz55d/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:30%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14047/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14047" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14047"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3pz967/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14048/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14048" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14048"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4b9wo7/"></a>(место составления акта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14049/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14049" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14049"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqwob3y/"></a>Мы,</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:95%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14050/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14050" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14050"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfzseec/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14051/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14051" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14051"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8lyu4f/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:95%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14052/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14052" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14052"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv6oeg8/"></a>(Ф.И.О. работников налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14053/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14053" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14053"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp1bmb0/"></a>при участии покупателя</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:80%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14054/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14054" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14054"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastn5grs/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14055/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14055" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14055"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasc2vzk6/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:80%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14056/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14056" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14056"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuvlcx3/"></a>(Ф.И.О. покупателя)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14057/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14057" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14057"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8e99p0/"></a>на основании приказа</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:80%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14058/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14058" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14058"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx1xq5b/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14059/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14059" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14059"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxlw1gg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:80%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14060/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14060" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14060"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbntvn7/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14061/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14061" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14061"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvmegy9/"></a>провели проверку</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:44.84%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14062/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14062" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14062"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnkigqi/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:35.58%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14063/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14063" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14063"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascnktxx/"></a>от &#171;___&#187;&#160;____________ 20__ года</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14064/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14064" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14064"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslm251z/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:44.84%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14065/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14065" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14065"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqbpwsd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:35.58%; overflow-wrap:break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14066/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14066" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14066"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasolio5w/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14067/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14067" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14067"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdagf4x/"></a>Проверка проведена при участии</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:69%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14068/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14068" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14068"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmtevt4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14069/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14069" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14069"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfuuugk/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:69%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14070/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14070" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14070"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast8fw6d/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14071/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14071" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14071"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp0fa0z/"></a>В ходе проверки проведен пересчет имеющегося остатка наличных денег в кассе налогоплательщика, поступивших от торговли (оказания услуг), и установлено наличие наличных денег в следующих купюрах:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14072/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14072" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14072"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0zkvf3/"></a>1) 100 000 сумовые х ______ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14073/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14073" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14073"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf6ur97/"></a>2) 50 000 сумовые х ______ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14074/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14074" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14074"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf7yybf/"></a>3) 10 000 сумовые х ______ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14075/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14075" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14075"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5uhh5s/"></a>4) 5 000 сумовые х ______ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14076/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14076" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14076"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase8yu3k/"></a>5) 1 000 сумовые х ______ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14077/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14077" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14077"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9bhp2a/"></a>6) монеты х ___________ штук = _________ сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14078/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14078" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14078"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgo8gh2/"></a>7) иностранная валюта: ____________________________________.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14079/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14079" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14079"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiw45es/"></a>Всего: _________ сум., _______________ иностранной валюты.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14080/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14080" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14080"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvfelrt/"></a>Об этом составлен настоящий акт и зачитан участникам.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14081/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14081" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14081"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas82ahe7/"></a>Сотрудники:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14082/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14082" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14082"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas18gayn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14083/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14083" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14083"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswax5yl/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14084/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14084" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14084"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxqu14i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14085/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14085" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14085"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1stzq7/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:40%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14086/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14086" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14086"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrpkbyu/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14087/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14087" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14087"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoacf4h/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14088/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14088" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14088"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2ekhg1/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14089/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14089" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14089"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg6hwz9/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14090/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14090" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14090"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa6e7hm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:40%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14091/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14091" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14091"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxxmdy5/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14092/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14092" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14092"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbmxmi8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14093/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14093" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14093"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyd5g73/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14094/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14094" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14094"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxd