ata-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas83iq5s/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:26%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14389/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14389" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14389"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1gr3f2/"></a>В ходе выемки участвовали</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:73%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14390/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14390" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14390"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4sm2vf/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14391/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14391" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14391"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9xh6g6/"></a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:26%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1qh560/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:73%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgq1yoi/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td style="width:1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas03c9f3/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7yb6zx/"></a>Налогоплательщику предъявлено постановление о выемке документов и (или) предметов и разъяснены права и обязанности.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasst2ey2/"></a>На основании постановления о выемке документов и предметов у налогоплательщика изъяты (добровольно выданы или ввиду отказа принудительно изъяты):</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase4iz7a/"></a>(наименование документов и (или) предметов, количество, особенности, стоимость)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14398/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14398" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14398"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgg09nu/"></a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14399/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14399" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14399"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastq8qx0/"></a>Процесс выемки с использованием средства</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14400/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14400" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14400"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvno5c8/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14401"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas75uehb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:58%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14402"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7dieia/"></a>(наименование аппарата, марка)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14403"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0tzzc6/"></a>снят на фото- или видеозапись, фото- , видеозаписи прилагаются.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14404"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspip9wo/"></a>(должность работника налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14405"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasc3oiql/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashscw84/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfash1ed7i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas19nfem/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:45%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd37v4l/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy3nsyq/"></a>&#160;</