nter"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvwlkee/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2grk8s/"></a>Участвовавшие лица:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14419/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14419" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14419"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslz47eo/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14420/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14420" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14420"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslglxc0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14421/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14421" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14421"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8e10g9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14422/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14422" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14422"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas53pfgi/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14423/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14423" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14423"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasez337f/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14424/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14424" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14424"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskgussm/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14425/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14425" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14425"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8hkis9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14426/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14426" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14426"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspdvfp1/"></a>(налогоплательщик)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14427/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14427" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14427"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0igzve/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14428/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14428" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14428"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasie9ge8/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14429/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14429" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14429"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2smp9q/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14430/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14430" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14430"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascgxg2y/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14431/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14431" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14431"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswlaiug/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14432/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14432" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14432"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrnhm45/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14433/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14433" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14433"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoa0unt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14434/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14434" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14434"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascdd1pc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14435/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14435" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14435"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoaydcc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14436/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14436" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14436"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskbdc3h/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14437/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14437" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14437"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5rs1dz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:39%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14438/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14438" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14438"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqyhthr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14439/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14439" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14439"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastx3s15/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14440/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14440" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14440"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasllreq1/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14441/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14441" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14441"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastgonet/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14442/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14442" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14442"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxrmwka/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14443/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14443" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14443"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4al4ah/"></a>Один экземпляр протокола получил &#171;___&#187;&#160;_______ 20___ года:</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit202/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14444/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14444" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14444"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascndlrl/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 14&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14445/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14445" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14445"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskxnnv0/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14446/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14446" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14446"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgn1o5n/"></a><strong>о воспрепятствовании налогоплательщиком допуску&#160;</strong><strong>работников налогового органа на территории или&#160;</strong><strong>в помещения (за исключением жилых помещений)&#160;</strong><strong>в ходе выездной налоговой проверки</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14447/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14447" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14447"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvgou1i/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14448/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14448" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14448"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslu1o9r/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14449/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14449" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14449"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7q5bgg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14450/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14450" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14450"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasihx3ua/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14451/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14451" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14451"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswixe68/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14452/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14452" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14452"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbcf9a3/"></a>(место составления акта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14453/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14453" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14453"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3ookk4/"></a>Я,</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14454/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14454" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14454"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspnfhut/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14455/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14455" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14455"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqaf1ep/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14456/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14456" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14456"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswz3cbu/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность должностного лица, составившего акт)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14457/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14457" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14457"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrg36m0/"></a>,</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14458/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14458" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14458"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8wf62k/"></a>(номер, дата приказа налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14459/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14459" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14459"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9qb0e5/"></a>(наименование, ИНН, адрес места нахождения налогоплательщика,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14460/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14460" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14460"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbukpcx/"></a>подлежащего выездной налоговой проверке)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:47%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14461/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14461" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14461"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascsnkek/"></a>установил совершение правонарушения:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:53%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14462/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14462" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14462"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas966qy1/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14463/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14463" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14463"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskae8hw/"></a>(место, время совершения правонарушения, содержание правонарушения,</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14464/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14464" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14464"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassanzvk/"></a>если совершено налоговое правонарушение, указываются статьи Налогового кодекса)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14465/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14465" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14465"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq29fqa/"></a>или</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14466/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14466" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14466"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn1gsl9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:96%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14467/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14467" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14467"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas60hck0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14468/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14468" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14468"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase8d16w/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:96%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14469/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14469" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14469"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgwx1gx/"></a>наименование, статья пункт соответствующего иного акта законодательства)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" colspan="2" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14470/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14470" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14470"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9nn3yw/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14471/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14471" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14471"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2c7g8g/"></a>Уведомляется, что на основании настоящего акта и в соответствии со статьей 111 Налогового кодекса, операции по банковским счетам налогоплательщика могут быть приостановлены.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14472/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14472" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14472"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskxoe68/"></a>Уклонение лица, совершившего правонарушение, от объяснений по данному случаю или подписания акта:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14473/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14473" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14473"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb3elfb/"></a>(краткое описание правонарушения, изложение совершенных действий (бездействия))</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14474/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14474" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14474"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbm0sq4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14475/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14475" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14475"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas77ltp4/"></a>Дополнения и приложения к акту:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14476/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14476" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14476"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyu646i/"></a>(видеозаписи &#8211; и фотоснимки, Ф.И.О. свидетелей и др.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14477/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14477" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14477"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg030tn/"></a>Лицу, совершившему правонарушение, разъяснены его права и обязанности, предусмотренные статьями 21 и 22 Налогового кодекса.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:53%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14478/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14478" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14478"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspvfkz8/"></a>(Ф.И.О. лица, совершившего правонарушение)</p></td><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14479/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14479" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14479"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgdg2cm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14480/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14480" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14480"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswcbnxi/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14481/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14481" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14481"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfmgmia/"></a>Акт составил:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:53%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask1i3uy/"></a>(Ф.И.О. и должность)</p></td><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast6lkvz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg3c12s/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit203/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp4pwtd/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 15&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrwy1sn/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspenutf/"></a><strong>выездной налоговой проверки</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9xc2cc/"></a><strong>№ _______</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx3ofmw/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4byhdb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14491" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14491"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasutirli/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14492/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14492" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14492"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxal6ff/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14493/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14493" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14493"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3qap8t/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14494/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14494" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14494"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa5zanb/"></a>(наименование территории)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14495/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14495" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14495"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnllso0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14496/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14496" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14496"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9wgpne/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность лица, проводящего выездную налоговую проверку)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasymozgd/"></a>на основании приказа</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas44dgqf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszgw6zw/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgzdacs/"></a>от &#171;___&#187;&#160;___________ 20__ года № _______, о проведении проверки проверил</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas18mdxb/"></a>(наименование, ИНН, адрес проверяемого налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasc8dx24/"></a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8csiut/"></a>(срок проведения проверки)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqe0tw3/"></a>Проверка проведена при участии</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:62%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslviaaa/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasagay51/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:62%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2cy139/"></a>(налогоплательщик и другие, принимавшие участие в проведении проверки)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom" colspan="2" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassp3xez/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" colspan="2" style="width:100%; wo