"bssPhr14568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9ada65/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass4k4iy/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit204/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast79k11/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 16&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasosy9io/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas96zqsd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1e8ugk/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgvr0di/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast7kvle/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7bhd9y/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2zxhhg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl8yagm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:38%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasptppbz/"></a>(наименование, ИНН и адрес налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasma3ybl/"></a><strong>ИЗВЕЩЕНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasldiucu/"></a><strong>о проведении налогового аудита</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1mp8gn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswlkzzp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14584" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14584"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3rohvd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14585/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14585" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14585"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9g8oco/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14586/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14586" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14586"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4zo3hp/"></a>(дата)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14587/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14587" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14587"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxypzpy/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14588/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14588" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14588"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuky4g3/"></a>настоящим сообщает, что на основании результатов анализа факторов риска, полученных путем отбора налогоплательщиков</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14589/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14589" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14589"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0yre2r/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14590/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14590" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14590"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrty4pk/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14591/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14591" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14591"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1cbpci/"></a>отнесен(о) к категории налогоплательщиков с высокой степенью риска.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14592/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14592" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14592"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrdlqg4/"></a>Налоговому аудиту подлежит период деятельности налогоплательщика с 20____ - 20 ______ год, по всем налогам и сборам или</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14593/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14593" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14593"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasokc4g7/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14594/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14594" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14594"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass2wyqg/"></a>(отдельный вид налога)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14595/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14595" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14595"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas77m08g/"></a>Начало налогового аудита &#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20__ г.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14596/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14596" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14596"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas850gl5/"></a>В соответствии со статьей 140 Налогового кодекса Республики Узбекистан до начала налогового аудита налогоплательщику необходимо подготовить следующие документы</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14597/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14597" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14597"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase0ipg4/"></a>В случае отсутствия налогоплательщика по заявленному месту регистрации, в течение пяти рабочих дней с даты направления уведомления необходимо представить в налоговый орган, направивший уведомление, информацию о фактическом месте нахождения с приложением копий подтверждающих документов.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14598/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14598" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14598"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1mp3bg/"></a>Документом, подтверждающим местонахождение налогоплательщика, является:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14599/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14599" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14599"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnqo9al/"></a>копия документа, удостоверяющего право собственности на недвижимое имущество (пользования им);</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14600/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14600" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14600"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqg3eia/"></a>копия договора аренды с лицом, на праве собственности которого находится недвижимое имущество.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14601/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14601" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14601"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskvht2w/"></a>Необходимо обеспечить участие руководителя (лица, временно исполняющего обязанности руководителя, или заместителя, имеющего право подписи) налогоплательщика при проведении налогового аудита по адресу регистрации (или расположения) налогоплательщика.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14602/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14602" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14602"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoovr5i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14603/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14603" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14603"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszgvicy/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14604/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14604" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14604"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbe9gg2/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14605/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14605" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14605"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr7tizw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14606/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14606" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14606"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswg1fz2/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14607/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14607" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14607"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas95yw1d/"></a>(должность, наименование налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14608/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14608" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14608"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswtwp32/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14609/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14609" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14609"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgf8692/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14610/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14610" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14610"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyweb41/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14611/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14611" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14611"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8t2dfn/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14612/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14612" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14612"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass2dw2v/"></a>Исполнитель:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:87%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14613/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14613" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14613"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3bwl8f/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:14%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14614/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14614" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14614"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm8ldi5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:87%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14615/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14615" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14615"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr3xhw0/"></a>(должность, Ф.И.О и номер телефона)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit205/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14616/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14616" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14616"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasagilq3/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 17&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14617/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14617" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14617"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskahgd8/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/bssPhr14618/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="14618" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr14618"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2ow5es/"></a><strong>о воспрепятствовании доступу&#160;</strong><strong>должностных лиц налогового органа,&#160;</strong><strong>проводящих налоговый аудит, на территории&#160;</strong><strong>или в помещения (за исключением жилых</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2f3zqg/"></a><strong>помещений) налогоплательщика</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswn1nqa/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasee0z9x/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6ontcu/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuwxwig/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiml62d/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgxeafb/"></a>(место составления)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasubulag/"></a>Я,</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:91%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3l8x24/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbniof7/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:91%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7rkbfb/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность должностного лица, составившего акт)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9gwk3y/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbpvfgy/"></a>(номер и дата приказа налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7ywchl/"></a>,</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbg4zhz/"></a>(наименование, ИНН, адрес налогоплательщика, подлежащего налоговому аудиту)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvhlsqx/"></a>установил совершение правонарушения:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmu485q/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn7ggnv/"></a>(место, время, содержание совершенного правонарушения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas43zgql/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasaf3gw5/"></a>(статьи Налогового кодекса, требования которой были нарушены)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslf07ga/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbcnd8z/"></a>(наименование, статьи иных актов налогового законодательства</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass950k7/"></a>в случае нарушения их требований)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasik72gw/"></a>На основании данного акта налоговый орган имеет право приостановить операции налогоплательщика по его счетам в банке на срок не более десяти дней, а также по имеющимся у налогового органа данным о проверяемом лице или данных об аналогичных налогоплательщиках вправе самостоятельно определить сумму налога, подлежащую уплате.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasybzeiy/"></a>Объяснение по нарушению или отказу от подписания акта со стороны лица, совершившего правонарушение:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascm00bc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb98q4p/"></a>(краткое описание состава правонарушения, изложение осуществленных действий (бездействий))</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6yepsn/"></a>Дополнения и приложения к акту:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswoim7z/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3zbgd6/"></a>((видео и фотосъемки, Ф.И.О. свидетелей) и т.д.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas872760/"></a>Лицу, совершившему правонарушение, разъяснены права и обязанности, предусмотренные статьями 21 и 22 Налогового кодекса:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:62%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1ihh41/"></a>(Ф.И.О лица, совершившего правонарушение)</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2h3vkp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas542ngu/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:62%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvi21oc/"></a>(Ф.И.О. свидетеля)</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx2g20g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas79irge/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:62%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasusgzwc/"></a>(Ф.И.О. свидетеля)</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbxdtqw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0tn089/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm6rpy1/"></a>Акт составил:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasydov9t/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5kgnb7/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7guz9p/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvk3uxu/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:50%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas419afr/"></a>(Ф.И.О и должность)</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskt078g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuebfpp/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit206/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9covie/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 18&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7pmkhr/"></a><strong>ПРОТОКОЛ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasorpw16/"></a><strong>осмотра территорий и помещений&#160;</strong><strong>проверяемого лица, документов&#160;</strong><strong>и предметов</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqvfw8l/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0dqwsq/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastopzau/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5326zb/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasinyo45/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrk75ge/"></a>(наименование территорий)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashnmp8x/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm89uwx/"></a>(номер и дата приказа, наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8wl9ct/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9v6rz8/"></a>(произведен осмотр территорий и помещений проверяемого лица,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascppqig/"></a>а также документов и предметов)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasggd4kg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgc3ysg/"></a>(наименование проверяемого субъекта предпринимательства)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgu21ce/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslq4k2i/"></a>(Ф.И.О. работника налогового органа, осуществляющего действия)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasonu7qs/"></a>Осмотр начат</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxhcbht/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1byggo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmkd068/"></a>окончен</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasekmqrl/"></a>.</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyil47d/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswbmmkq/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg1g062/"></a>(время)</p></td><td style="width:1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv2lblr/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx9diwb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4gzddh/"></a>(время)</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2292c5/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq47lpa/"></a>При осмотре произведена</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:71%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7v03gg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:24%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5eb79h/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:71%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6gz55o/"></a>(фотосъемка и видеозапись, сняты копии с документов или</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastqnlf4/"></a>произведены другие действия, связанные с осмотром)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa5zvdu/"></a>Осмотр произведен при участии и (или) в присутствии:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasflwm9z/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:28%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1geg4r/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:37%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5emf6v/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdo4c0w/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbgqutc/"></a>(Ф.И.О., при необходимости адрес)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslfsk2g/"></a>Налогоплательщику, а также лицам, участвующим в процедуре осмотра, разъяснены их права и обязанности.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastmgxgs/"></a>Фото и видеосъемка процесса осмотра произведена</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassgblam/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa8r4be/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0qcw6a/"></a>(наименования марки аппарата, серия)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5yg5l8/"></a>фотографические снимки, видеозаписи прилагаются.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas41eg1g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasob00ml/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxzgmwh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd97f6c/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgyg4wg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuz3x1v/"></a>(должность ответственного работника налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdcfo08/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfoya8c/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaschm647/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxdffg6/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9x5onv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrtm5bw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastmg6vx/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7vdyzc/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi4yyda/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasod9k1y/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszr7ceg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1sodtx/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspmg1mo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascskcdl/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdmhw3t/"></a>Присутствующие лица:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass8bfdm/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgonihz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb1gmtt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasokyviw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasplsf6w/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask9z405/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" colspan="2" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvbwqxq/"></a>(субъект предпринимательства, должность)</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq6f9qh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas276cxq/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvdlfr9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/