nchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgx07ve/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask01k25/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm2cgk8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasg20oau/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2l15pc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" colspan="2" style="width:43%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6bt9as/"></a>(представитель)<sup>1</sup></p></td><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas44iufg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1xwhry/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvvidzz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy81t3z/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1mcgso/"></a>Копию протокола получил</p></td><td style="width:57%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2dkp16/"></a>&#171;_____&#187; _______ 20___ год __________________________ ________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasixmsfw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:57%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv899cy/"></a>(день) (месяц) (подпись) (Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit207/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszyguxq/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 19&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfask0d3a0/"></a><strong>ТРЕБОВАНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrat7cs/"></a><strong>о представлении документов (информации)</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:41%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszrsbr5/"></a>На основании приказа № ____ от ____ _______ г.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:59%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskgp3hr/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:41%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasba4916/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:59%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslncprv/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasv8cfyg/"></a>в соответствии со статьей 140 Налогового кодекса проводится налоговый аудит</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashkmbb3/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgv65f5/"></a>(наименование налогоплательщика, у которого проводится налоговый аудит)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa6kh4g/"></a>В течение пяти дней со дня получения настоящего требования необходимо предоставить в</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashtqtkz/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasay5p7q/"></a>(наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasumxv03/"></a>следующие документы (информацию), необходимые для проверки:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascqmv40/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgpot3b/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnqg15h/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbza02p/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3w21mb/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5dqo7o/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaseu6kq0/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasctp6vy/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:67%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaseh9p0l/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2z4uho/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfast4w9pz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8cysrh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3py79k/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:67%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasczu6gk/"></a>(должность должностного лица налогового органа, проводящего проверку)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashwrguz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastz4vcq/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasphey5g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:17%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9kb9de/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit208/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvvs1nl/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 20&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasm3c3bk/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascg3mr7/"></a><strong>об отказе в представлении&#160;</strong><strong>или непредставлении в установленные&#160;</strong><strong>сроки документов при проведении&#160;</strong><strong>налогового аудита</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasaqtaz7/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4gyset/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy1yfez/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfases0hgf/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9g4s4y/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2pqyv2/"></a>(место составления)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszscq02/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3gnei2/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность составившего должностного лица)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgl9v04/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfassf6r48/"></a>(номер, дата приказа налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasotnaay/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso65rwg/"></a>(наименование, ИНН, адрес налогоплательщика, у которого проводится налоговый аудит)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:13%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskeco5r/"></a>правонарушение:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:80%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspau02u/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas04tvfg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvengh0/"></a>(место, время, содержание совершенного правонарушения)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas13i2e5/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgtenko/"></a>статья, пункт нарушены Налогового кодекса, требования которых нарушены)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasykym5d/"></a>или</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfx5bbg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmg1k0g/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiufc2v/"></a>(наименование, статья, пункт иных актов законодательства)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiyrskl/"></a>На основании данного акта налоговый орган имеет право приостановить операции налогоплательщика по его счетам в банке на срок не более десяти дней, а также по имеющимся у налогового органа данным о проверяемом лице или данных об аналогичных налогоплательщиках вправе самостоятельно определить сумму налога, подлежащую уплате.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasomv8dr/"></a>Отказ лица, совершившего правонарушение, от дачи объяснений или подписания акта:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyurp8m/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0n2hkv/"></a>(краткое описание состава правонарушения, изложение осуществленных действий (бездействий)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasavgi0f/"></a>Дополнение и приложение к акту:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw7716n/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbtdnof/"></a>(видео и фото, Ф.И.О. свидетелей и т.д.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasitu2yt/"></a>Лицу, совершившему правонарушение, разъяснены права и обязанности, предусмотренные статьями 21 и 22 Налогового кодекса:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:51%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9gtin3/"></a>(Ф.И.О лица, совершившего правонарушение)</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8mb8wk/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmcy7o1/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:51%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5yoe0a/"></a>(Ф.И.О свидетеля)</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass5blkk/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa41525/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:51%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp2hfmb/"></a>(Ф.И.О свидетеля)</p></td><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8azymt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaseaf75w/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasako6vv/"></a>Протокол составил:</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4lutz6/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase6kogp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswezlgq/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:19%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasutyoml/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:32%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2cegub/"></a>(должность и Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td style="width:16%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf38dqg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfdcka2/"></a>(подпись)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit209/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasukrilt/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 21&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoap3lv/"></a><strong>ПОСТАНОВЛЕНИЕ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu93a7o/"></a><strong>должностного лица, проводящего налоговый аудит,&#160;</strong><strong>о производстве выемки документов и предметов</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw0zdvn/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas40w1pk/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas434kmf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaschvokf/"></a>(день) (месяц)</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswvga4h/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskpdhai/"></a>(место составления)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq7i2k2/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi3blud/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность должностного лица, проводящего налоговый аудит)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas14gq5w/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascvey3o/"></a>(дата, номер приказа руководителя (заместителя руководителя), наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1xg13w/"></a>в ходе проведения налогового аудита</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas81o3bl/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass5mgrf/"></a>(наименование, ИНН налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspgmcnn/"></a><strong>УСТАНОВИЛ:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb4huhp/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasopxgfr/"></a>(изложение обстоятельств: выемка копий документов,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6espsk/"></a>подтверждающих правонарушение,</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasza2zmn/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfmfe5y/"></a>или оригиналов документов с целью предотвращения внесения изменений</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas32td2l/"></a>или замены документов)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasct9po1/"></a>на основании статей 26, 146, 148 Налогового кодекса Республики Узбекистан</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxakqgs/"></a><strong>ПОСТАНОВИЛ:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslllslg/"></a>произвести изъятие у</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:77%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashkq6q4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvpq0sf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasye3d89/"></a>(наименование, ИНН налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvgr2tp/"></a>следующие копии или оригиналы:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass1slsd/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvk07g3/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqk29ow/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1g9vyl/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxsytcu/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyt011e/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasex4igk/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslvmzlx/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrlbg9q/"></a>Подпись должностного лица налогового органа</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:56%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb5t3n5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspyq69e/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasniv58x/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasfne8l3/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrdq6b1/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:56%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas5gdwlt/"></a>(должность должностного лица налогового органа)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiphq08/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas20p55r/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnibxp2/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:29%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasymkshf/"></a>(Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbylf5f/"></a>С постановлением о выемке документов и предметов ознакомлен:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasn61dhy/"></a>(Ф.И.О. руководителя или представителя налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfase90ti4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0xoa5k/"></a>(дата)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxf922i/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasf0gq5y/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasiygzq6/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit210/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas0gk7ed/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 22&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas80o2bf/"></a><strong>ПРОТОКОЛ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastplgeb/"></a><strong>о выемке документов и предметов</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswtoo5k/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr1ey19/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8qn65h/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:35%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasyfwoq2/"></a>(место составления)</p></td><td style="width:31%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7f0q2y/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxslnkk/"></a>(дата)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasluoqqa/"></a>В ходе проведения налогового аудита</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaskofcfd/"></a>(наименование, ИНН налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdfvh1c/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность лица, вынесшего постановление, наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasgiybkg/"></a><strong>У С Т А Н О В И Л:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasoisal5/"></a>(основания (причины) для выемки документов и предметов)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdv9mb0/"></a>На основании статьей 26, 146, 148 Налогового кодекса Республики Узбекистан</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastsgoi8/"></a><strong>П О С Т А Н О В И Л:</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnudq1v/"></a>Произвести выемку у</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:72%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrqbtsf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:20%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl2g4nz/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:72%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa9agt5/"></a>(наименование, ИНН налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmzdh0u/"></a>Следующие документы и предметы:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashm63ci/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspvcatt/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastu5wp1/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:94%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4bpgbc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7cgila/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswqr8c4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasinzym1/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaso211gg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:56%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4wl7os/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2e3gwn/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswq2f3w/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp4o4vx/"></