/td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw12zzt/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastfm2sv/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasa5pwyg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2r9e4i/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuy8pq9/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasla672n/"></a>(дата)</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp26zdb/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:22%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastn8ysp/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas259p51/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit211/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastpvg4w/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 23&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasykgnfp/"></a><strong>ПРИКАЗ № ____</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl5hhxe/"></a><strong>(постановление, распоряжение)</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasezml7m/"></a>По</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas00bq1h/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvwqrns/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:89%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8i8agb/"></a>(наименование организации)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasttzkka/"></a>от &#171;_____&#187; __________________________ 20___ г.</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6a94kg/"></a>Для проведения инвентаризации в</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:53%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu1swx4/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas21n1qs/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:53%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9xevb9/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass0gagv/"></a>назначается специальная инвентаризационная комиссия (постоянно действующая, рабочая) в составе:</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:26%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbiv3ym/"></a>1. Председатель (должность, Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:51%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu883mm/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:26%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass8t1nb/"></a>2. Члены комиссии (должность, Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:51%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasaby3st/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9b77g3/"></a>Инвентаризации подлежат</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3lhwgn/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqtanl3/"></a>(имущество и финансовые обязательства)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaswp56lk/"></a>К инвентаризации приступить</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:60%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas2s2tlx/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashfglyw/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:60%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu5geit/"></a>(дата)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasy1m9x8/"></a>и окончить</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:86%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3yve16/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas7akkgg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:86%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasw3fkyl/"></a>(дата)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnin21f/"></a>Причина инвентаризации</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasd1lbkc/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasapv319/"></a>(контрольная проверка, смена</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasau100w/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width:100%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp212fr/"></a>материально-ответственных лиц, переоценка и т.д.)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasnph0pl/"></a>Материалы по инвентаризации представить в бухгалтерию</p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdBottom" style="width:98%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3o76o8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:25%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu2gctk/"></a>не позднее 20__ г.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdgogk4/"></a>Руководитель</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="6"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17078/tit212/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfass0q3w7/"></a><strong>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 24&#160;</strong><strong>к Положению</strong></span></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas93dywn/"></a><strong>АКТ</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasp4mt4x/"></a><strong>налогового аудита</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasck4l8o/"></a>&#171;____&#187;&#160;___________ 20___ год</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas76a1g0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasx7z6gg/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:46%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvz2879/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:21%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxdyeyu/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:33%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasapc2ga/"></a>(место составления акта)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9w4296/"></a><strong>I. Вводная часть.</strong></p><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfashtalr6/"></a>1)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasc0oyc8/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasl9hek4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq0916h/"></a>(номер и дата приказа о проведении налогового аудита, Ф.И.О. руководителя (заместителя) налогового органа, подписавшего приказ)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaszb1cgc/"></a>2)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslm9cu8/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas79zmsm/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6ouma3/"></a>(Ф.И.О., должность проверяющего должностного лица, наименование налогового органа)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasrfacr2/"></a>3)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas197cpv/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasq79lgo/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas6bqlal/"></a>(полное и сокращенное наименования и идентификационный номер налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasxvghhm/"></a>4)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaslp20uz/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasflmss4/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3gx3ah/"></a>(налоговый период, подлежащий налоговому аудиту)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfastm7254/"></a>5)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas1hwa05/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasu5m25r/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasflck3g/"></a>(дата начала и окончания налогового аудита)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasi3x6go/"></a>6)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasagz13b/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasozfsdh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasskha6v/"></a>(сведения об электронной регистрация налогового аудита, а при отсутствии возможности -</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqrgx2c/"></a>дата и номер заполнения в книге регистрации проверок)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3rd8w9/"></a>7)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbzx3qf/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas9gx7lh/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4v12e7/"></a>(дата предоставления руководителю или представителю налогоплательщика (Ф.И.О.)</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuhqooq/"></a>приказа о проведении налогового аудита, а также перечня документов и сведений,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8frfkt/"></a>подлежащих представлению для проверки)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasbyy49n/"></a>8)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas3gtmr6/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas8nprgg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfaspkf9gp/"></a>(отметка о разъяснении налогоплательщику его прав и обязанностей, а также прав органов налоговых органов)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasls8dzh/"></a>9)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas11d79h/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasuyvb51/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasksayru/"></a>(сведения о лицах, обладающих правом первой и второй подписи на финансовых документах налогоплательщика за проверяемый период)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdq2zvs/"></a>10)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasqprn78/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas69muof/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdxgacs/"></a>(правовые основания создания налогоплательщика, регистрация в государственных органах)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasmgqg5i/"></a>11)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasb3qrnt/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasvsk9np/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasli7qpb/"></a>(свидетельство о включении в государственный реестр налогоплательщиков)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasepu2g8/"></a>12)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasr45qri/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasexn7ft/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfasdv2dol/"></a>(сведение о видах деятельности налогоплательщика)</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4rg8he/"></a>13)</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfascilm2c/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/17078/dfas4dasq0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td class="bdTop" style="width:93%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/docum